# Shell scripts must stay LF, whatever the developer's core.autocrlf is set to.
# The repository already stores LF, but `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites them to
# CRLF on checkout — and /bin/sh in the container then rejects the shebang with
# `#!/bin/sh^M: No such file or directory`, so the backend never starts.
*.sh text eol=lf
